  m_text: "Controls:\nMovement: WASD\nJump: Spacebar\nDash: Left Shift\nPause: P\nShoot:
    Left Mouse Button\nAim: Mouse\nStats: Left Tab\n\nMechanics: \nBlastt jellyfish
    with bubbles and don't let them touch you. Every 3 defeats a green healing fish
    will drop. Look for the pearl spouting sparks to face your final challenge."
